<title>UK: Deutsche Bau- und Boden sets 200 mln Dem FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau- und Boden sets 200 mln Dem FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU- UND BODENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    24.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    24.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.71     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
